WEBVTT

00:01:41.020 --> 00:01:43.480
<b>Odd Jobs Gin-chan</b>

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:45.090
The hell?

00:01:45.090 --> 00:01:47.080
It won't make a sound?

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:48.490
What's wrong, Gin-san?

00:01:48.490 --> 00:01:52.370
<b>Sugar Content</b>

00:01:48.490 --> 00:01:52.370
The damn TV just closed its eyes 
with a dark look on its face.

00:01:52.760 --> 00:01:54.790
Maybe it has something on its mind?

00:01:54.790 --> 00:01:56.480
It hasn't adjusted to 
the digital transition?

00:01:56.480 --> 00:01:58.630
It's probably time to buy a new one.

00:01:59.110 --> 00:01:59.930
Huh?

00:02:00.240 --> 00:02:02.660
Is this how the TV always looked?

00:02:02.750 --> 00:02:03.770
Huh?

00:02:03.770 --> 00:02:04.960
Now that you mention it...

00:02:05.260 --> 00:02:08.680
Some guy from Edobashi Camera 
brought it over the other day.

00:02:08.680 --> 00:02:11.970
Maybe it's from one of our clients?

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:13.250
I don't remember taking any

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:14.900
jobs that involved 
defective merchandise.

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:15.620
Click.

00:02:16.210 --> 00:02:17.380
Oh, it turned on.

00:02:17.380 --> 00:02:18.980
Gin-san, the TV's fixed.

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:24.140
There's someone familiar on the screen.

00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:26.300
A face I didn't want to see 
is sticking out of the TV.

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:29.160
This is a 3D TV.

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:31.450
Whoa, 3D? That's amazing.

00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:33.580
How do I turn it off?

00:02:34.360 --> 00:02:37.050
Press your lips against the button here.

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:37.830
I see.

00:02:38.840 --> 00:02:40.720
Sadaharu, turn the TV off.

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:42.080
And turn her off while you're at it.

00:02:43.490 --> 00:02:44.430
Bulk trash.

00:02:44.920 --> 00:02:46.370
Wait!

00:02:46.370 --> 00:02:47.820
Wait a moment!

00:02:50.180 --> 00:02:50.680
Huh?

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:56.220
Is something wrong?

00:02:56.220 --> 00:02:58.470
N-No, it's nothing.

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:00.500
Just that my glasses broke.

00:03:00.500 --> 00:03:02.590
Were they important to you?

00:03:02.590 --> 00:03:03.190
Huh?

00:03:03.190 --> 00:03:04.440
Y-Yes...

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:06.090
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:03:06.090 --> 00:03:07.630
It's not a big deal.

00:03:07.630 --> 00:03:08.530
They were cheap.

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:09.800
Don't worry about it.

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:11.720
It's just that they were 
from my late grandmother...

00:03:11.720 --> 00:03:12.670
Huh?

00:03:12.670 --> 00:03:13.440
But...

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:16.310
You should probably buy a new pair.

00:03:16.310 --> 00:03:17.280
Yes?

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:18.440
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:20.210
They're all I have to remember 
her by, but I'm fine,

00:03:20.210 --> 00:03:21.480
so don't worry about it.

00:03:21.480 --> 00:03:23.900
But you're crying.

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:25.160
I-I'm not!

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:26.890
It's just that a piece 
of lens got in my eye.

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:27.850
Wait, what?!

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:30.970
Hmm, it looks okay, but 
your eyes are totally red.

00:03:30.990 --> 00:03:32.800
You should go to the hospital.

00:03:32.800 --> 00:03:34.460
Want me to take you there?

00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:35.290
It's okay!

00:03:35.290 --> 00:03:36.820
Don't worry about it!

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:38.270
Just ignore those guys.

00:03:38.270 --> 00:03:39.790
I'll take you to the hospital.

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:40.480
Let's go, Sa-chan.

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:42.230
Wait!

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:43.950
Something's wrong with this situation!

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:45.990
Why is it all awkward 
like I accidentally hit

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:48.730
a girl in the face while 
playing dodgeball?!

00:03:48.730 --> 00:03:50.830
It was clearly her fault!

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.490
She basically moved her face

00:03:52.490 --> 00:03:54.620
into the ball and broke her glasses!

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:56.800
I'm sorry, Gin-san.

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:58.900
It's been so long since

00:03:58.900 --> 00:04:01.290
my last appearance that I overdid it.

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:02.680
I'm sorry!

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:03.790
I'll be leaving then!

00:04:03.790 --> 00:04:05.130
Ah! Sa-chan-san!

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:07.910
Wh-Why are you looking at me?

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:09.100
What are you trying to say?

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:11.130
Even you, Sadaharu?!

00:04:11.130 --> 00:04:17.140
<b>Glasses Are Part of the Soul</b>

00:04:17.140 --> 00:04:19.140
<b>Glasses for Edogawa</b>

00:04:19.140 --> 00:04:21.020
They're all so lovely!

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:22.890
Which one should I pick?

00:04:22.890 --> 00:04:24.740
It's like a dream come true!

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:27.590
Gin-san buying a pair 
of glasses for me...

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:32.400
<b>Both Nearsighted and Farsighted</b>

00:04:27.880 --> 00:04:30.530
Thank you for breaking, Grandma.

00:04:30.560 --> 00:04:32.400
I won't let your death be for nothing!

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:34.340
Which should I pick?

00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:37.300
Maybe I should ask 
Gin-san to pick for me?!

00:04:37.300 --> 00:04:40.370
How about one of the pairs 
in that clearance bin?

00:04:41.100 --> 00:04:43.090
I can't see a thing.

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:44.740
But if this is what you like,

00:04:44.740 --> 00:04:46.100
I'll go with these.

00:04:46.100 --> 00:04:47.010
Do they fit?

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:48.170
How do I look?

00:04:48.170 --> 00:04:49.360
Cute, very cute.

00:04:48.170 --> 00:04:55.930
<b>Super Cheap</b>

00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:50.910
You look perfect.

00:04:50.910 --> 00:04:54.070
Like you were born wearing those.

00:04:54.070 --> 00:04:55.930
Mister, Mister.

00:04:56.300 --> 00:04:59.180
Are you searching for 
engagement glasses?

00:04:59.410 --> 00:05:00.940
What the hell are engagement glasses?

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:01.810
I've never heard of those!

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:03.340
And wait,

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:05.310
haven't we met before?

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:09.570
Young lady, I see that 
you have excellent taste.

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:11.820
There's a story behind those glasses.

00:05:11.820 --> 00:05:14.580
The lens used in the famous 
Battle of Red Cliffs

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:17.080
by the Wu to set fire 
to Cao Cao's forces

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:18.540
were made by a man whose glasses lenses

00:05:18.610 --> 00:05:20.050
were made by a man whose glasses lenses

00:05:20.050 --> 00:05:21.790
were made by a man whose glasses 
lenses were seen by a man

00:05:21.790 --> 00:05:22.910
who wore this particular 
pair of glasses.

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:24.830
That doesn't mean a damn thing!

00:05:25.460 --> 00:05:26.710
We'll take these, Gramps.

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:30.450
Since they're used, 
give us a 99% discount.

00:05:30.450 --> 00:05:31.700
Huh? Wait a moment.

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:33.820
There's a story behind those glasses.

00:05:33.820 --> 00:05:36.610
The lens used in the famous Trojan 
Horse during the Trojan War...

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:41.160
Um... Thank you, Gin-san.

00:05:41.160 --> 00:05:42.970
I don't know how to show

00:05:42.970 --> 00:05:45.220
my gratitude for these 
wonderful glasses.

00:05:45.220 --> 00:05:47.760
I've never received such a 
wonderful and stinky present.

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:49.350
Glad to hear it.

00:05:49.350 --> 00:05:51.980
Why don't you walk her home, "Gin-san"?

00:05:52.730 --> 00:05:56.100
I'll ask Gengai to fix 
your Grandma's glasses,

00:05:56.100 --> 00:05:57.890
so just use those for the time being.

00:05:57.890 --> 00:05:59.260
No, it's okay.

00:05:59.260 --> 00:06:00.000
Huh?

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:04.780
Grandma would yell at me 
for clinging to the past.

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:07.060
Goodbye...

00:06:07.060 --> 00:06:09.800
Grandma's glasses which 
were stepped on by Dad

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:10.950
who was stepped on by Mom

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:12.210
who stepped on the poop 
of a dog whose owner

00:06:12.210 --> 00:06:14.090
had a daughter that owned the 
store which sold these glasses.

00:06:14.090 --> 00:06:14.730
What?!

00:06:14.730 --> 00:06:16.590
That doesn't mean a damn thing?!

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:20.570
I'll think of these glasses 
as you and never let them go!

00:06:20.570 --> 00:06:22.390
I'll treasure them forever!

00:06:25.180 --> 00:06:26.890
Oh well.

00:06:34.770 --> 00:06:36.650
Open wide!

00:07:00.800 --> 00:07:03.300
<b>Love Garden</b>

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:06.310
Put on the damn glasses!

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:08.860
The hell are you doing 
with those glasses?!

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:10.810
Why are you going on a date and going 
all the way with a pair of glasses?!

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:14.260
Gin-san, are you jealous of Glassin-san?

00:07:14.260 --> 00:07:15.680
Who the hell is Glassin-san?!

00:07:15.680 --> 00:07:17.130
You've got it wrong, Gin-san.

00:07:17.130 --> 00:07:20.440
I was planning on putting 
on Glassin-san right away.

00:07:20.780 --> 00:07:22.920
But when I thought of them as you,

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:24.330
I got all nervous...

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:27.360
But I'm finally ready now, so...

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:29.580
I'm going to p-put...

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:34.840
<b>Love Garden</b>

00:07:29.990 --> 00:07:30.730
No, I can't say it!

00:07:30.730 --> 00:07:31.740
It's too embarrassing!

00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:33.090
Why are you making the act of

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:34.840
putting on glasses sound so dirty?!

00:07:35.270 --> 00:07:36.850
But they're like another you!

00:07:36.850 --> 00:07:39.440
If I put them on, it's like, you know?

00:07:39.440 --> 00:07:41.170
The two of us become one!

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:42.560
How can you turn the act of putting

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:44.050
on glasses into such a big deal?

00:07:44.050 --> 00:07:45.590
And those are like another random

00:07:45.590 --> 00:07:47.100
old guy who owns the glasses store.

00:07:47.850 --> 00:07:48.850
Here you go.

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:51.940
I got your glasses fixed.

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:53.850
Just throw away that filthy pair.

00:07:54.270 --> 00:07:55.280
Now listen to me.

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:57.150
If you don't want your 
glasses broken again,

00:07:57.150 --> 00:07:59.420
never sneak into our house again.

00:08:00.180 --> 00:08:00.860
I refuse.

00:08:02.050 --> 00:08:04.380
How can you come slinking back

00:08:04.380 --> 00:08:06.210
and acting like you're my boyfriend?

00:08:06.370 --> 00:08:07.750
Now, I...

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:08.870
I...

00:08:10.090 --> 00:08:11.740
I'm devoted to Glassin-san!

00:08:11.740 --> 00:08:12.750
I want Glassin-san!

00:08:13.020 --> 00:08:14.750
It has to be Glassin-san!

00:08:15.130 --> 00:08:17.690
I can't even imagine wearing 
another pair of glasses.

00:08:17.690 --> 00:08:19.170
Don't treat me like one of those

00:08:19.170 --> 00:08:21.350
loose-eared sluts that 
constantly switches glasses!

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:22.630
The hell is a loose-eared slut?

00:08:23.470 --> 00:08:26.740
I got these fixed because 
you kept complaining.

00:08:26.740 --> 00:08:29.090
Besides, those glasses 
aren't your prescription,

00:08:29.090 --> 00:08:30.130
so you can't see a thing, right?

00:08:30.130 --> 00:08:31.400
That's dangerous.

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:33.760
Leave Glassin-san and me alone!

00:08:34.050 --> 00:08:35.380
It's too...

00:08:35.380 --> 00:08:36.890
It's too late to try 
to be nice to me now!

00:08:36.890 --> 00:08:38.020
What's up with this conversation?

00:08:38.020 --> 00:08:40.360
Why does it sound like a love triangle?!

00:08:40.860 --> 00:08:43.110
Never show your face around 
Glassin-san and me again!

00:08:43.300 --> 00:08:45.060
Farewell, former glasses!

00:08:45.060 --> 00:08:46.290
Farewell, former lover!

00:08:51.240 --> 00:08:52.290
I'll buy you a drink.

00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:54.330
What's going on?

00:08:54.330 --> 00:08:56.140
Why do I feel like I was just dumped?

00:08:56.140 --> 00:08:58.790
Hey! Is this country full of idiots?!

00:09:00.300 --> 00:09:04.550
<b>Dango House</b>

00:09:01.590 --> 00:09:02.550
The target?

00:09:02.550 --> 00:09:04.550
A government official, 
Zenkichiro Yoneda.

00:09:04.820 --> 00:09:06.420
Preparations have been made by

00:09:06.420 --> 00:09:07.760
previously dispatched agents.

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:09.180
Your mission is to rendezvous

00:09:09.180 --> 00:09:10.810
with the agents and take out the target.

00:09:11.740 --> 00:09:13.750
Will you return to the path of evil

00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:16.810
for the sake of saving 
the weak masses, Sa-chan?

00:09:18.300 --> 00:09:21.320
Sometimes, evil can only 
be eradicated by evil.

00:09:22.350 --> 00:09:27.580
I'm willing to get my hands 
bloody to save others...

00:09:27.580 --> 00:09:29.380
Sa-chan, those aren't dango.

00:09:32.240 --> 00:09:34.470
Echimoya, you're so bad!

00:09:34.470 --> 00:09:37.580
Please, I pale in comparison to you.

00:09:37.580 --> 00:09:38.840
Come closer.

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:42.630
I have a question to ask 
you before we begin.

00:09:44.050 --> 00:09:45.970
Who is she?

00:09:46.180 --> 00:09:47.590
Intruders!

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:51.180
Damn intruders!

00:09:51.180 --> 00:09:52.680
Cut 'em all down!

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:54.310
I'll act as a decoy.

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:58.620
While I draw their attention, 
you all should escape.

00:09:58.620 --> 00:10:00.200
But Sa-chan...

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:01.230
Don't you understand?

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:05.180
I can't unleash my 
strength with you around!

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:06.430
Sa-chan...

00:10:07.390 --> 00:10:08.610
Now hurry!

00:10:08.780 --> 00:10:10.240
Escape!

00:10:11.160 --> 00:10:13.570
Sarutobi, I'll make this easy.

00:10:13.570 --> 00:10:14.620
Switch glasses.

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:17.860
I heard that you're not getting 
any assassination work.

00:10:17.860 --> 00:10:19.500
Only makes sense after all the mistakes,

00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:22.130
and you even injured your own men.

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:26.780
There are rumors that you're in a slump,

00:10:26.780 --> 00:10:28.540
but you can't fool me.

00:10:28.540 --> 00:10:31.390
You can't see a thing, can you?

00:10:31.390 --> 00:10:33.500
Th-That's not true.

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:36.890
Can you see what I'm doing right now?

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:38.420
What?

00:10:38.420 --> 00:10:39.900
You're just talking to me.

00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:40.930
No.

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:44.690
I'm applying Preparation 
H in front of your face...

00:10:46.420 --> 00:10:48.490
I-Impressive...

00:10:48.490 --> 00:10:50.010
You're using your mastery of your other

00:10:50.010 --> 00:10:51.670
senses to compensate for 
the lack of eyesight.

00:10:51.670 --> 00:10:54.660
However, a ninja lives 
and dies by the eyes.

00:10:55.190 --> 00:10:57.460
You were able to become a member of

00:10:57.460 --> 00:10:59.040
the Oniwaban despite your poor eyesight

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:01.890
because of natural talent and hard work,

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:05.050
but those custom-made Iga 
glasses also played a role...

00:11:05.610 --> 00:11:07.360
Why are you wearing those glasses?

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:10.930
You should know very well that 
this world isn't a playground.

00:11:15.300 --> 00:11:17.670
It's none of your business.

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:20.310
If I decide to wear these glasses...

00:11:20.740 --> 00:11:23.060
If I can't find any work...

00:11:23.820 --> 00:11:26.040
If only it were that simple.

00:11:26.550 --> 00:11:28.940
The way things stand, you're 
gonna get yourself killed.

00:11:29.340 --> 00:11:33.750
The former head assassins 
are acting suspiciously.

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:39.460
Does Sarutobi intend to desert?

00:11:39.600 --> 00:11:42.100
She may intend to defect 
to a different group

00:11:42.100 --> 00:11:45.460
and provide them with information on us.

00:11:45.660 --> 00:11:46.870
Even if she doesn't,

00:11:46.870 --> 00:11:48.270
she could still create headaches

00:11:48.270 --> 00:11:52.410
by getting herself captured 
and leaking information.

00:11:54.080 --> 00:11:56.510
We have no choice but to take her out.

00:11:57.600 --> 00:12:03.340
Once you've lost their trust, 
they'll come for you.

00:12:04.710 --> 00:12:07.230
The Assassins of Assassins Squad!

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:10.240
The Lethal Punishers!

00:12:10.570 --> 00:12:12.050
P-Punishment?!

00:12:12.730 --> 00:12:16.250
Does it involve whips and candles 
and things of that nature?!

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:18.240
Why are you getting excited?

00:12:19.270 --> 00:12:22.930
These assassins are trained 
to kill assassins.

00:12:23.620 --> 00:12:25.790
Do you stand a chance 
with those glasses on?

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:29.510
I don't care what happens to you,

00:12:29.510 --> 00:12:32.580
but if you die a dog's death,

00:12:32.580 --> 00:12:36.000
it'll make the rest of the 
former Oniwabanshu look bad.

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:38.980
Try to avoid that.

00:12:42.600 --> 00:12:44.110
These were the first...

00:12:44.110 --> 00:12:47.020
The first present from Gin-san...

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:51.030
But I'm not allowed to wear them.

00:13:14.000 --> 00:13:16.890
I believe that you are 
Lady Ayame Sarutobi.

00:13:17.190 --> 00:13:18.490
Is that correct?

00:13:22.090 --> 00:13:25.010
I see that nobody ever 
taught you any manners.

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:27.180
A gentleman would

00:13:27.180 --> 00:13:30.400
never interrupt a girl who's crying.

00:13:30.560 --> 00:13:32.550
My policy is to

00:13:32.550 --> 00:13:36.410
gently wipe away the 
tears when a woman cries.

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:38.280
I see.

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:39.910
How kind of you.

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:42.410
So what do you do...

00:13:42.410 --> 00:13:44.370
...when the woman happens to be 
your target for assassination?!

00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:55.920
I'll wipe away your tears.

00:13:56.820 --> 00:13:59.800
And I'll wipe away your blood, as well.

00:14:02.220 --> 00:14:04.560
Ayame Sarutobi the assassin.

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:07.180
Our superiors have 
determined that you are

00:14:07.180 --> 00:14:08.650
no longer necessary.

00:14:09.830 --> 00:14:11.290
Thus, we Lethal Punishers

00:14:11.290 --> 00:14:13.940
have been charged with your disposal.

00:14:17.780 --> 00:14:22.450
If you have any last words, 
we'll hear you out.

00:14:22.920 --> 00:14:24.400
Do you have anything to say?

00:14:27.990 --> 00:14:28.830
Say...

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:33.560
Would you let me put on my glasses?

00:14:37.010 --> 00:14:39.470
<b>Greater Edo Hospital</b>

00:14:39.470 --> 00:14:40.770
Fool...

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:43.470
I told you not to die a dog's death.

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:46.730
Why did this happen to Sa-chan-san?

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:48.730
Look at these.

00:14:49.160 --> 00:14:50.830
She kept wearing these glasses

00:14:50.830 --> 00:14:52.790
when they weren't the 
right prescription.

00:14:53.160 --> 00:14:55.020
As a result, she kept 
screwing up on the job

00:14:55.020 --> 00:14:56.990
and attracted the attention 
of the higher-ups.

00:14:57.850 --> 00:15:00.420
When I found her on the verge of death,

00:15:00.420 --> 00:15:03.490
she was still holding those glasses.

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:06.950
I don't care how happy they made her.

00:15:06.950 --> 00:15:08.750
She's a fool.

00:15:10.370 --> 00:15:12.750
Can you dispose of those?

00:15:12.750 --> 00:15:15.130
<b>Greater Edo Hospital</b>

00:15:13.170 --> 00:15:15.130
They'll find this place very soon.

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:18.630
She won't stand a chance 
if those are still around.

00:15:19.110 --> 00:15:22.140
Well, if she still 
refuses to put these on,

00:15:22.140 --> 00:15:25.510
that's the end of that.

00:15:25.510 --> 00:15:27.210
Hey, hemorrhoid ninja!

00:15:27.210 --> 00:15:30.520
You're going to leave 
Sa-chan all alone here?!

00:15:31.850 --> 00:15:36.070
Sorry, but ninja don't band 
together the way samurai do.

00:15:36.540 --> 00:15:40.030
If you don't want to 
die, stay away from her.

00:15:40.030 --> 00:15:43.160
I'm sure that's what she wants.

00:15:45.240 --> 00:15:46.850
I'm...

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:51.290
I'm sorry...

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:55.790
They were a present from Gin-san.

00:15:56.290 --> 00:16:00.560
I promised to treasure them.

00:16:03.410 --> 00:16:11.600
I'm sorry I broke my promise.

00:16:14.430 --> 00:16:15.780
Sa-chan...

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:25.620
You don't need to see a thing right now.

00:16:26.940 --> 00:16:28.470
Don't need to see a thing.

00:16:29.380 --> 00:16:31.540
When you wake up,

00:16:31.540 --> 00:16:33.620
there won't be any 
cracks in your vision.

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:35.380
Gin-san...

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:37.440
Can't help it.

00:16:37.440 --> 00:16:39.210
I'm the one who broke her glasses.

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:45.270
The Assassins of Assassins 
of Assassins Squad!

00:16:45.270 --> 00:16:47.430
Lethal Odd Jobs is moving out!

00:17:33.910 --> 00:17:36.190
The hell are you doing in my house?!

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:38.350
Why are you sneaking 
into my house in the

00:17:38.350 --> 00:17:40.390
middle of night to make fried 
rice all dramatic-like?!

00:17:40.390 --> 00:17:42.150
And turn off the damn music!

00:17:42.150 --> 00:17:43.520
It's bothering the neighbors!

00:17:44.730 --> 00:17:45.720
What is this?

00:17:45.720 --> 00:17:47.820
Seriously, why are you here?

00:17:47.820 --> 00:17:50.900
Well, people usually get 
hungry around this time.

00:17:50.900 --> 00:17:52.200
So we were making a little snack.

00:17:52.520 --> 00:17:54.090
Wait up. This is my house.

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:55.990
Those are my eggs, my ham.

00:17:55.990 --> 00:17:57.210
My fried rice!

00:17:57.210 --> 00:17:58.630
Don't worry!

00:17:58.630 --> 00:18:00.810
We made enough for you!

00:18:00.810 --> 00:18:02.210
That's not the issue here!

00:18:02.590 --> 00:18:04.320
I'm asking why you're in my house!

00:18:04.320 --> 00:18:05.440
Don't tell me you actually 
came here to make fried ri--

00:18:05.720 --> 00:18:07.510
Oh, Sadaharu's here.

00:18:07.510 --> 00:18:08.200
Over there.

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:09.750
Just set her down there.

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:11.110
Uh, wait. Er, what?

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:12.550
Why did you bring Sarutobi here?

00:18:12.550 --> 00:18:15.510
Well, we're going to 
take on the assassins,

00:18:15.510 --> 00:18:17.730
but we don't want to 
fight in a hospital.

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:20.260
So we were trying to find a good place.

00:18:20.260 --> 00:18:21.860
Oh, I see.

00:18:21.860 --> 00:18:23.390
I'm rich and own a big house.

00:18:23.390 --> 00:18:24.700
Plus I'm single so 
nobody else is around,

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:26.210
so nobody else will be inconvenienced.

00:18:26.210 --> 00:18:27.320
That's the logic you used.

00:18:27.320 --> 00:18:28.640
What kind of logic is that?!

00:18:28.640 --> 00:18:29.430
Now, now, now.

00:18:29.430 --> 00:18:30.660
We're just borrowing your place.

00:18:30.660 --> 00:18:31.640
It won't take long.

00:18:31.640 --> 00:18:33.570
We're just gonna kill 
four or five assassins.

00:18:33.570 --> 00:18:35.750
You're going to turn my 
house into a murder scene?!

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:37.590
Hey, why are you eating?!
Get out of here!

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:40.150
I don't want blood and 
innards all over my room!

00:18:40.150 --> 00:18:42.250
I'm actually a clean freak!

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:46.050
That's why you're still single.

00:18:46.050 --> 00:18:48.630
Women can't stand men who are perfect.

00:18:48.830 --> 00:18:52.130
The ideal would be a man 
whose room is a little messy.

00:18:52.130 --> 00:18:54.140
Hey! That's way too big of a mess!

00:18:54.140 --> 00:18:55.640
What should we do, Gin-san?

00:18:55.640 --> 00:18:58.350
Now that the trap is 
set, where do we wait?

00:18:58.350 --> 00:18:59.020
Wait!

00:18:59.020 --> 00:19:00.150
What are you doing?! Seriously, stop!

00:19:00.880 --> 00:19:02.290
How about the ceiling?

00:19:02.290 --> 00:19:02.970
Hey!

00:19:02.970 --> 00:19:03.970
I'm seriously gonna kill you!

00:19:03.970 --> 00:19:05.900
I'll assassinate your ass 
before the assassins get here!

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:07.800
I'll wait here.

00:19:07.800 --> 00:19:08.820
Wait! I got it!

00:19:08.820 --> 00:19:10.120
I got it so stop!

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:10.970
I'll help!

00:19:10.970 --> 00:19:11.920
I'll give you a hand!

00:19:11.920 --> 00:19:14.290
So stop destroying my house!

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:23.900
Uh, do you read me?

00:19:23.900 --> 00:19:24.920
Hattori here.

00:19:24.920 --> 00:19:26.340
I'm right above Sarutobi.

00:19:26.780 --> 00:19:29.030
Is everybody in position?

00:19:29.030 --> 00:19:30.960
No problem. Everything's fine.

00:19:30.960 --> 00:19:33.100
It's really hot.

00:19:33.530 --> 00:19:35.850
Are you sure about this?

00:19:36.350 --> 00:19:39.070
It's not perfect, but 
I did what I could.

00:19:39.070 --> 00:19:40.600
We're up against professional killers.

00:19:41.000 --> 00:19:43.030
They know that Sarutobi and 
the rest of you are here.

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:45.020
They'll be extremely cautious,

00:19:45.020 --> 00:19:48.110
so we can use that to our advantage.

00:19:48.110 --> 00:19:49.860
<b>Kagura  Shinpachi  Sadaharu  
Sarutobi  Zenzo  Gintoki</b>

00:19:49.020 --> 00:19:51.850
I left the entrance to the room where 
Sarutobi is completely unguarded.

00:19:49.860 --> 00:19:55.240
<b>Enemy  Enemy  Enemy</b>

00:19:51.850 --> 00:19:53.750
So they won't come from that direction.

00:19:53.750 --> 00:19:55.780
It's clearly a trap.

00:19:55.780 --> 00:19:57.870
They'll circle around.

00:19:58.070 --> 00:20:00.650
If anything goes wrong, 
let us know immediately.

00:20:00.650 --> 00:20:04.380
Be ready to react if they 
come through the front.

00:20:04.660 --> 00:20:05.830
Don't let your guard down.

00:20:05.830 --> 00:20:08.130
And don't destroy my house.

00:20:08.130 --> 00:20:08.880
Got it?

00:20:09.070 --> 00:20:09.870
Roger.

00:20:10.680 --> 00:20:11.750
Yeah.

00:20:14.840 --> 00:20:17.390
Damn, why do I have to do this?

00:20:17.660 --> 00:20:18.390
Huh?

00:20:18.390 --> 00:20:19.160
Wait a second.

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:20.740
Was someone asleep?

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:22.140
Someone sounded asleep!

00:20:22.650 --> 00:20:24.380
I'm calling roll again.

00:20:24.380 --> 00:20:25.020
Roger.

00:20:30.720 --> 00:20:31.890
Oh, shit.

00:20:32.280 --> 00:20:33.460
Hey!

00:20:33.460 --> 00:20:35.280
Somebody ran off to Don Quijote!

00:20:35.280 --> 00:20:36.410
Don't give me that crap!

00:20:36.410 --> 00:20:38.040
I'm trying to help here!

00:20:38.570 --> 00:20:40.860
Get your ass back here, 
whoever went to Don Quijote!

00:20:40.860 --> 00:20:42.010
Roger.

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:44.400
Hey, Shinpachi.

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:46.750
Help me put Kagura on Sadaharu's back.

00:20:47.000 --> 00:20:49.070
You all went to Don Quijote!

00:20:49.070 --> 00:20:49.900
Wait a second!

00:20:49.900 --> 00:20:52.800
One of you is asleep in Don Quijote?!

00:20:53.190 --> 00:20:55.130
The hell is going on?!
Why did they all ditch me?!

00:20:55.130 --> 00:20:57.300
They could have invited me along!

00:20:57.300 --> 00:20:58.550
Not that I wanted to go!

00:20:58.550 --> 00:20:59.640
Oh, right.

00:20:59.640 --> 00:21:02.110
Could you buy some Preparation H?

00:21:02.110 --> 00:21:04.480
I'm out. The suppository type.

00:21:06.710 --> 00:21:07.920
Hello?

00:21:07.920 --> 00:21:09.250
Do you read me?

00:21:12.180 --> 00:21:13.630
Stop lying!

00:21:13.630 --> 00:21:15.480
Don't pretend to be asleep!

00:21:15.480 --> 00:21:18.080
Even the dog was 
pretending to be asleep!

00:21:18.370 --> 00:21:20.180
The bastards are toying with me.

00:21:20.180 --> 00:21:21.130
I'm pissed!

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:21.900
Screw this!

00:21:21.900 --> 00:21:23.830
I've had enough!

00:21:24.430 --> 00:21:25.240
This sensation...

00:21:25.740 --> 00:21:27.280
Someone's here.

00:21:28.820 --> 00:21:30.130
Two on the roof.

00:21:30.810 --> 00:21:32.230
One inside.

00:21:33.800 --> 00:21:34.940
And in the yard...

00:21:36.110 --> 00:21:41.090
I can smell multiple humans.

00:21:41.670 --> 00:21:43.180
As expected.

00:21:43.850 --> 00:21:46.990
But it doesn't matter 
how many there are.

00:21:46.990 --> 00:21:49.360
This time, we'll finish her off.

00:21:49.730 --> 00:21:51.860
Along with the others.

00:21:52.800 --> 00:21:54.490
Th-They're here...

00:21:55.250 --> 00:21:57.740
Excuse me, do you have 
any Preparation H?

00:21:58.030 --> 00:22:00.240
The hell are they doing?!

00:22:04.670 --> 00:22:05.500
Hurry!

00:22:05.990 --> 00:22:08.880
Hurry back!

00:22:10.960 --> 00:22:12.960
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:23:40.010 --> 00:23:44.970
<b>Next Episode
Glasses Prevent You From Seeing Certain Things</b>

00:23:40.970 --> 00:23:42.190
Next time:

00:23:42.190 --> 00:23:44.970
Glasses prevent you from 
seeing certain things.
